%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 200 150
%%LanguageLevel: 2
%%EndComments
% An 80 x 60 DeviceCMYK JPEG (photo-cmyk.jpg) as an image, then a red square.
gsave
20 15 translate 160 120 scale
/DeviceCMYK setcolorspace
<< /ImageType 1 /Width 80 /Height 60 /BitsPerComponent 8 /Decode [0 1 0 1 0 1 0 1]
   /ImageMatrix [80 0 0 -60 0 60]
   /DataSource currentfile /ASCII85Decode filter /DCTDecode filter >> image
